'''Hackey''' (ヒウマ, ''Hiuma'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Tackey]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

